      "responseContract": "appcall-provider-json-v1",
      "adaptations": [
        "Credential-only healthcheck maps to the pinned validator GET /groups?limit=1.",
        "Official help copy asks for Content-Type on GET; native GET reads omit Content-Type because the pinned executor only sets it when a body is present.",
        "Sender can answer HTTP 200 with {success:false, message:...} on some errors. Native bodyErrorPaths cannot invert a success boolean, so a non-empty top-level message is the documented error signal."
      ]
    },
